OL,3,GNEWSABlind veteran pays tribute to
OL,4,Afallen comrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Welsh Guardsman whose military
OL,7,Fcareer ended when he was blinded in an
OL,8,Fassault is among thousands set to
OL,9,Fhonour the lives of those lost in war.
OL,11,FClive Jones, from Market Drayton, laid
OL,12,Fa tribute at the Royal British Legion's
OL,13,FField of Remembrance in Staffordshire
OL,14,Fat the opening of its annual display.
OL,16,FAround 30,000 handwritten messages are
OL,17,Fexpected to be planted this year at the
OL,18,FNational Remembrance Gardens in
OL,19,FAlrewas.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
