OL,3,GNEWSABlind veteran pays tribute to
OL,4,Afallen comrades
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's phenomenal. It's emotional. It
OL,7,Falways pulls at the heartstrings for
OL,8,Fme," said Jones, a Royal British Legion
OL,9,Fambassador.
